":"Breastplate of Bloodthirst","level":60,"reqLevel":57,"side":"Both","summary":"In order to create the Breastplate of Bloodthirst, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 10 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 5 Arcanite Bars; 5 Skin of Shadow.You will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.","type":"Elite","start":{"name":"Malyfous's Catalogue","kind":"object","zone":618,"zoneName":"Winterspring","coord":[61,38.8]},"end":{"name":"Malyfous Darkhammer","kind":"npc","zone":618,"zoneName":"Winterspring","coord":[61,38.6]},"rewards":{"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[]}},{"id":975,"name":"Cache of Mau'ari","level":60,"reqLevel":55,"side":"Both","summary":"Speak to Witch Doctor Mau'ari again in a moment to receive the lucky charm.","start":{"name":"Witch Doctor Mau'ari","kind":"npc","zone":618,"zoneName":"Winterspring","coord":[61.8,38.2]},"end":{"name":"Witch Doctor Mau'ari","kind":"npc","zone":618,"zoneName":"Winterspring","coord":[61.8,38.2]},"chain":{"id":"969","step":2,"length":2},"rewards":{"choices":[],"items":[[12384,1]],"rep":[]}},{"id":5063,"name":"Cap of the Scarlet Savant","level":60,"reqLevel":57,"side":"Both","summary":"In order to create the Cap of the Scarlet Savant, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 5 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 8 Arcane Crystals; 5 Enchanted Scarlet Thread. You will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.","type":"Elite","start":{"name":"Malyfous's Catalogue","kind":"object","zone":618,"zoneName":"Winterspring","coord":[61,38.8]},"end":{"name":"Malyfous Darkhammer","kind":"npc","zone":618,"zoneName":"Winterspring","coord":[61,38.6]},"rewards":{"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[]}},{"id":4804,"name":"Chillwind E'ko","level":60,"reqLevel":55,"side":"Both","summary":"In Winterspring, you will fight great flying creatures called da Chillwind. These 